There are more clothes in front of me.
I now take a skirt in my hand.
It is a yellow cotton skirt.
Its yellow colour is very nice.
I put on that skirt.
I look in the mirror.
This skirt is very small.
It is not big.
It is very tight on me.
This skirt is not good.
Then I look at its price.
There is a tag on it.
The skirt's price is very high.
It is very expensive.
I do not want this yellow skirt.
I take it off.
I put that skirt aside.
Now I look at the next piece of clothing.
